<!--
  Hypervisor System Requirements, chapter "Support routines".
-->
<chapter xmlns="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook" version="5.0"
         xml:id="hv-lib">
  <title>Support routines</title>
  <para>The hypervisor has the routines of the C library that it needs,
    which it shares with the JetOS kernel.</para>

  <section xml:id="SRQ_HV_LIB_001" role="requirement">
    <title>SRQ_HV_LIB_001</title>
    <para>The hypervisor shall provide, for itself, the routines that
      copy and fill memory and the formatted output to its console, with
      the behaviour of the C standard for the conversions that they have.</para>
    <formalpara>
      <title>Rationale</title>
      <para>The hypervisor cannot use the library of another program.</para>
    </formalpara>
    <formalpara>
      <title>Verification</title>
      <para>Test.</para>
    </formalpara>
  </section>

  <section xml:id="SRQ_HV_LIB_002" role="requirement">
    <title>SRQ_HV_LIB_002</title>
    <para>The hypervisor shall provide the computation of the CRC-32 of a
      block of bytes (the polynomial of zlib and Ethernet).</para>
    <formalpara>
      <title>Rationale</title>
      <para>The check of the image is made with it.</para>
    </formalpara>
    <formalpara>
      <title>Verification</title>
      <para>Test.</para>
    </formalpara>
  </section>
</chapter>
